* NGSPICE Behavioral Model for ADG901 RF/Analog Switch
* Pin Order: RF1 CTRL GND VDD RF2

.SUBCKT ADG901 RF1 CTRL GND VDD RF2

* 1. Voltage-Controlled Switch Model
* Ron = 2 Ohms (Switch Closed)
* Roff = 10 MegOhms (Switch Open)
* Threshold = 1.4V (Logic HIGH/LOW boundary)
S1 RF1 RF2 CTRL GND SW_MODEL

.MODEL SW_MODEL VSWITCH (RON=2 ROFF=10Meg VT=1.4V VH=0.2V)

.ENDS ADG901
